{"at": "2026-11-04T10:28:57.678Z", "run": "20261104-0645-expand-debrid-ec52", "unit": "u06", "op": "set", "rid": "storage/seedr-free-tier", "path": "$.free_tier.stated", "old": "Free tier exists with an unpublished base allowance ('a low storage limit'); no GB figure is stated on the vendor pages. Free bonus space: 500MB for each of up to 4 referred signups, up to 2GB total.", "new": "Free tier: 2GB of storage (FAQ: 'Free: 2GB'), 480p streaming, no daily or monthly transfer limits. Paid plans start at Lite, $3.95/mo for 10GB.", "rung": "documented", "evidence": {"url": "https://www.seedr.cc/faq/", "date": "2026-11-04", "proved": "the FAQ states 2GB of storage for a free account", "capture": "sha256:1552ee55d271c9255aeafb9a4b3ee62a18e39cbd852fc71caceb135b93130fac", "quote": "• Free: 2GB"}, "added": true, "reason": "the FAQ publishes a 2GB free storage figure"}
{"at": "2026-11-04T10:28:57.678Z", "run": "20261104-0645-expand-debrid-ec52", "unit": "u06", "op": "set", "rid": "storage/seedr-free-tier", "path": "$.retention.stated", "old": "no retention statement was extracted from the seed's quota and limits prose; absence here is a gap in this conversion, not a vendor claim that retention is unlimited", "new": "Files remain in storage until deleted; free and paid accounts keep files indefinitely.", "rung": "documented", "evidence": {"url": "https://www.seedr.cc/faq/", "date": "2026-11-04", "proved": "free accounts keep files indefinitely", "capture": "sha256:1552ee55d271c9255aeafb9a4b3ee62a18e39cbd852fc71caceb135b93130fac", "quote": "Both free and paid accounts keep files indefinitely."}, "added": true, "reason": "the FAQ states a retention rule"}
